@startuml
!include _style.iuml
' Adapted from reviewed presentation sources: W2-delivery-ledgers, W3-07a; separate SQL commit / relay / consumer
skinparam dpi 110
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 17
skinparam ClassStereotypeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 16
skinparam LegendFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 24
hide footbox
hide circle
title DP-2 · local delivery ledgers and relay roles
top to bottom direction
class "MediaOutbox" as MO <<outbox>> $MEDIA {
 + message_id: UUID
 + body_hash: str
 + body: dict
 + claim_token: UUID | None
}
class "ProcessingInbox" as PI <<idempotent inbox>> $PROC {
 + message_id: UUID
 + body_hash: str
}
class "ProcessingOutbox" as PO <<outbox>> $PROC {
 + message_id: UUID
 + queue: str
 + body: dict
}
class "MediaInbox" as MI <<idempotent inbox>> $MEDIA {
 + message_id: UUID
 + body_hash: str
}
class "sql\ndelivery" as D <<relay>> $INFRA {
 {static} + accept(session, model, envelope)
 {static} + stage(session, model, envelope, queue)
 {static} + publish_due(factory, model, transport, *,\n limit=100, deadline=None, replay_seconds=518400,\n reservation_seconds=30)
}
class "SQS\ndelivery.sqs" as S <<transport adapter>> $INFRA {
 + send(queue, envelope)
}
D -down-> S : network send
S -[hidden]down- MO
MO -[hidden]right- PI
PI -[hidden]down- PO
PO -[hidden]left- MI
MO .right.> PI : commands
PO .left.> MI : results
D ..> MO : stages / relays
D ..> PO : stages / relays
D ..> PI : deduplicates
D ..> MI : deduplicates
legend bottom
No cross-database FK or transaction; dashed links are delivery
dependencies.
Media models: media.messaging_models; Processing models:
processing.messaging_models.
Each message_id is a local primary key. Business state commits
with its local ledger.
endlegend
@enduml
